    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25904" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαστᾰσῐάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>form into separate factions,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1303b26
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἐποίκους . . πρὸς τοὺς
				εὐπόρους</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1306a3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πλῆθος, τὴν πόλιν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
