				<u>BJ</u>
				1.11.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cam.</u>
				36
			</span></i>; <i>set at variance,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῶμα καὶ ψυχήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					3.8.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>to be at variance,</i>
