			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.82.4
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					54.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ἀληθέσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Myst.</u>
					9.4
				</span></i>
			: abs., ib. <i><span class="en">
				4.9
			</span></i>.</div>
